  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Multisectoral assistance for the most vulnerable households in north-west Syrian Arab Republic (Idleb and Aleppo)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In light of significant political change in Syria, access shifts and increased mobility of populations, IOM is providing flexible and adaptable multisectoral shelter, camp coordination and camp management (CCCM), and water, sanitation and hygiene (WASH) assistance to the most vulnerable households in Idleb and Aleppo governorates. This intervention targets communities and displaced populations residing inside and outside of established sites, as well as for people on the move.</narrative>
  </description>
